          "snippet": {
            "line": 80,
            "text": "theorem integral_l2Norm_cumulative_eq_sq {f : VelocityField} (hf : Continuous f)\n    (hcf : HasCompactSupport f) (T : ℝ) :\n    (∫ t in (0 : ℝ)..T, 2 * l2Norm f t * cumulativeForceNorm f t) =\n      (cumulativeForceNorm f T) ^ 2"
